# React Anti-Patterns and Code Quality Rules

These rules cover the most critical code-level issues in React applications. During `/review` or when implementing features, the agent MUST check for these patterns.

This file is an index. Each rule's Do/Don't example and fix live in a themed file under `.cursor/rules/react-antipatterns/` — load only the one you need rather than the whole catalog. Detection scanning and severities live in `docs/design/PR_REVIEW.md`; agent conduct lives in `.cursor/rules/react-antipatterns/agent-conduct.mdc`.

| Code | Pattern | Fix | Detail |
| ---- | ------- | --- | ------ |
| R1 | Missing useEffect Cleanup | Add cleanup return | `.cursor/rules/react-antipatterns/hooks-and-effects.mdc` |
| R2 | Stale Closure in Callbacks | Use `prev =>` | `.cursor/rules/react-antipatterns/hooks-and-effects.mdc` |
| R3 | Object/Array Dependencies Causing Infinite Loops | Use `useMemo` or primitives | `.cursor/rules/react-antipatterns/hooks-and-effects.mdc` |
| R4 | State Update on Unmounted Component | Add abort handling | `.cursor/rules/react-antipatterns/state-and-async.mdc` |
| R5 | Direct State Mutation | Use spread/map | `.cursor/rules/react-antipatterns/state-and-async.mdc` |
| R6 | Missing Error Boundaries | Wrap with boundary | `.cursor/rules/react-antipatterns/errors-and-async-safety.mdc` |
| R7 | Race Condition in Async State Updates | Add cancelled flag | `.cursor/rules/react-antipatterns/state-and-async.mdc` |
| R8 | Conditional Hook Calls | Move hooks to top | `.cursor/rules/react-antipatterns/hooks-and-effects.mdc` |
| R9 | Index as Key in Dynamic Lists | Use stable ID | `.cursor/rules/react-antipatterns/rendering-and-memoization.mdc` |
| R10 | Unhandled Promise Rejections | Add error handling | `.cursor/rules/react-antipatterns/errors-and-async-safety.mdc` |
| R11 | Context Overuse for Frequent Updates | Split context | `.cursor/rules/react-antipatterns/rendering-and-memoization.mdc` |
| R12 | Inline Functions Breaking Memoization | Use `useCallback` | `.cursor/rules/react-antipatterns/rendering-and-memoization.mdc` |
| R13 | Missing Dependency Array in useEffect | Add `[]` or deps | `.cursor/rules/react-antipatterns/hooks-and-effects.mdc` |
| R14 | Derived State Anti-Pattern | Compute in render | `.cursor/rules/react-antipatterns/state-and-async.mdc` |
| R15 | Ref Manipulation Without Cleanup | Add `removeEventListener` | `.cursor/rules/react-antipatterns/hooks-and-effects.mdc` |
| R16 | Unbounded Main Thread Blocking | Web Worker / `useTransition` | `.cursor/rules/react-antipatterns/web-vitals-and-sre.mdc` |
| R17 | Network Waterfalls & Request Storms | Hoist to parent/loader | `.cursor/rules/react-antipatterns/web-vitals-and-sre.mdc` |
| R18 | LocalStorage Abuse | Debounce / try-catch / indexedDB | `.cursor/rules/react-antipatterns/web-vitals-and-sre.mdc` |
| R19 | LCP Failures | Eager load primary content | `.cursor/rules/react-antipatterns/web-vitals-and-sre.mdc` |
| R20 | CLS Violations (Layout Shifts) | Add width/height or skeleton | `.cursor/rules/react-antipatterns/web-vitals-and-sre.mdc` |
| R21 | Third-Party Script Contention | Add `defer` | `.cursor/rules/react-antipatterns/web-vitals-and-sre.mdc` |

Rule titles in the Pattern column match their `## Rn — <title>` headings verbatim, so a search for either finds both.
